<%# The per-arm numbers behind one phase diagram: how often a self-replicator emerged at
    each grid value, and how quickly. Flagged is the detector's candidate crossings, emerged
    the ones a replicator confirmed. `arms` is a list of Experiments::ArmSummary. %>
<figure class="table-figure mt-4">
  <%# The caption sits outside .table-scroll: inside it, it is laid out at the table's width
      and clipped mid-word on a phone. %>
  <figcaption class="table-caption text-sm text-muted" id="arms-of-<%= axis.name %>">
    Arms of <%= axis.name.to_s.humanize.downcase %>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-labelledby="arms-of-<%= axis.name %>">
    <table class="data-table" aria-labelledby="arms-of-<%= axis.name %>">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th><%= axis.name.to_s.humanize %></th>
          <th class="numeric">n</th>
          <th class="numeric">Flagged</th>
          <th class="numeric">Emerged</th>
          <th class="numeric">Median epoch</th>
          <th class="numeric">IQR</th>
          <th class="numeric">Censored</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% arms.each do |arm| %>
          <tr>
            <td class="mono"><%= arm.label %></td>
            <td class="numeric"><%= arm.runs_finished %></td>
            <td class="numeric">
              <span class="mono"><%= arm.flagged %>/<%= arm.runs_finished %></span>
              <span class="text-muted">
                <%= percent_value arm.flagged_rate.fraction %>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td class="numeric">
              <span class="mono"><%= arm.emerged %>/<%= arm.runs_finished %></span>
              <span class="text-muted">
                <%= percent_value arm.emergence_rate.fraction %>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td class="numeric mono">
              <%= epoch_value(arm.median_epoch) %>
              <% if arm.flagged > arm.emerged %>
                <span class="text-muted" title="Median epoch over every flagged crossing, confirmed or not">
                  flagged <%= epoch_value(arm.flagged_median_epoch) %>
                </span>
              <% end %>
            </td>
            <td class="numeric mono"><%= epoch_value(arm.q1_epoch, arm.q3_epoch) %></td>
            <td class="numeric"><%= arm.censored %></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">
    Flagged counts the crossings the transition detector reported; emerged counts the ones the
    replicator census or the copy rate confirmed. The median epoch and the IQR are of the
    confirmed emergences, the flagged median beside them in grey; a flagged crossing nothing
    confirmed is censored like a run that was never flagged.
  </p>
</figure>
